# Dependencies
/vendor/

# Composer
composer.phar
# NOTE: composer.lock is deliberately NOT ignored here — this repo commits it by
# S440 law (see 2cf7ad9 and tests/SecurityAuditCheckTest.php's
# testTheCommittedLockExists); a composer.lock ignore line is a silent trap —
# inert while the lock is tracked, unable to re-add it without -f after any
# removal — kept out on purpose, not an oversight.

